.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-runner-controller-token-rotate \- Rotate a token for a runner controller. (EXPERIMENTAL)


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab runner-controller token rotate   [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Replaces the current token with a new one. Store the new token value
securely before closing the terminal. You cannot retrieve the token
again. Prompts for confirmation before rotation. Use \fB--force\fR
to skip the confirmation prompt in non-interactive contexts.

.PP
This feature is an experiment and is not ready for production use.
It might be unstable or removed at any time.
For more information, see
https://docs.gitlab.com/policy/development_stages_support/.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-f\fP, \fB--force\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompt.

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Rotate token 1 for runner controller 42 (with confirmation prompt)
glab runner-controller token rotate 42 1

# Rotate without confirmation
glab runner-controller token rotate 42 1 --force

# Rotate and output as JSON
glab runner-controller token rotate 42 1 --force --output json
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-runner-controller-token(1)\fP
